<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Translation Auto-Approved</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: #28a745; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; background: #f8f9fa; }
        .success { background: #d4edda; border: 1px solid #c3e6cb; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 5px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>✅ Translation Auto-Approved</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <h2>Translation Request Completed</h2>
            
            <div class="success">
                <strong>🎉 AUTO-APPROVED:</strong> Your translation request has been automatically approved and completed.
            </div>
            
            <h3>Request Details:</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Request ID:</strong> {{request.id}}</li>
                <li><strong>Description:</strong> {{request.description}}</li>
                <li><strong>Status:</strong> {{request.status}}</li>
                <strong>Reason:</strong> No response within 3 days of completion
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>What Happened:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Your translation was completed and ready for review</li>
                <li>You had 3 days to review and approve</li>
                <li>No response was received within the timeframe</li>
                <li>The system automatically approved the translation</li>
                <li>Final payment has been processed to the translator</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>Current Status:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>✅ Translation: Completed</li>
                <li>✅ Approval: Auto-approved</li>
                <li>✅ Payment: Processed</li>
                <li>✅ Project: Archived</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>Important:</strong> The translated files are available in your project. You can download them from your account.</p>
            
            <p>Thank you for using HereToTranslate. We hope you're satisfied with the translation quality.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message from HereToTranslate</p>
            <p>Please do not reply to this email</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
